warning[W0016]: this writes to a copy of `xs[index("a  b")]`, and nothing reads the copy
 --> W0016-text.sisu:9:5
  |
8 |     let mut a = xs[index("a  b")]
  |             - a copy
9 |     a.b = 3
  |     ^^^ `xs[index("a  b")]` does not change
  |
  = help: `xs` is a plain parameter, so `xs[index("a  b")]` cannot change here: delete the write, or return the changed copy

